WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:07.300
Hello, I'm Dr. Joshua Kassis, founder and chiropractor at the Balanced Chiropractic Centre in Yandina.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:11.710
On behalf of our entire team, I'd like to welcome you to our practice.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:22.910
The Balanced Chiropractic Centre opened its doors in 2023 after transforming what was once a local pharmacy into a modern, wellness-focused chiropractic centre.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:29.730
Our vision was simple: to create a place where people and families could discover the true cause of their health concerns.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.110
restore their health naturally and live life to the fullest potential.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:41.350
Since opening, we've had the privilege of helping hundreds of people in our local community and we're excited to have the opportunity to meet you.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:47.620
The purpose of this video is to help you understand what to expect during your first visit at our practice.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.040
Whether this is your first time seeing a chiropractor

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:56.030
or you've had chiropractic care before, your first appointment is all about you.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:04.450
We’ll take the time to understand your health history, your current concerns, your challenges and most importantly your health goals.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:11.300
We believe that every person has a unique story, so we'll listen carefully before carrying out any examination.

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:17.730
Our goal is to determine exactly what's causing your problem and whether chiropractic care is the right fit for you.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:24.580
If it is, we'll perform an assessment using our advanced technology including a state-of-the-art inflammation scanner

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:29.410
that will clearly and specifically show us the hotspots in your spine and body,

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:37.470
as well as convenient on-site digital x-rays which help us identify areas of stress and dysfunction within your body.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:42.560
Having these tools under one roof allows us to gain a clear understanding of your body

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:45.700
to provide care that's tailored specifically to you.

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:48.990
People come to our practice for many different reasons.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:55.200
Some are already experiencing symptoms such as neck pain, headaches, lower back issues, sciatica,

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.560
disc injuries, shoulder pain or even just poor posture.

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:03.710
Others are looking for answers after trying multiple treatments without any results.

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:10.080
We also care for families, children and people who simply want to optimise their health and wellbeing.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:13.060
While many people initially visit us

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:21.350
because they're in pain, they stay because they experience the benefits of a healthier nerve system and a body that functions the way that it was designed to.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:30.820
At the Balanced Chiropractic Centre, we focus on finding and correcting the underlying cause of dysfunction rather than simply masking symptoms.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:35.810
We know your nerve system controls every function, including how well it heals.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.160
Before you come in, I'd like you to think about two simple questions.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:43.750
First one, are you as healthy as you want to be?

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.380
and the second,

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.560
if not,

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.740
what’s stopping you from getting there?

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:57.570
Again, I'm Dr. Josh and we look forward to meeting you, learning your story and helping you take the next step on your journey towards a much better health.
